nics"},{"text":"Firmware"},{"text":"Industrial design"},{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Validation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Career Progression"},{"type":"h","text":"Wearable Engineering Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech/B.E.","Wearable Technology Intern","Junior Wearable Tech Engineer","Wearable Tech Engineer","Senior Wearable Systems Engineer","Principal Wearable Engineer","Wearable Systems Architect"]},{"type":"h","text":"Sports Technology Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech","Sports Technology Engineer","Sports Performance Technology Engineer","Senior Sports Technology Engineer","Sports Technology Specialist","Sports Technology Lead","Head of Sports Technology"]},{"type":"h","text":"Embedded Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech","Embedded Wearable Engineer","Embedded Systems Engineer","Senior Embedded Engineer","Wearable Systems Architect","Principal Embedded Engineer"]},{"type":"h","text":"AI Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech","Wearable Data / ML Intern","Wearable AI Engineer","Senior Wearable AI Engineer","Edge AI / Sensor Intelligence Specialist","AI Systems Architect"]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technologies"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-Powered Wearables"},{"type":"p","text":"AI is moving wearables beyond basic step counting toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Personalized coaching"},{"text":"Activity recognition"},{"text":"Fatigue estimation"},{"text":"Recovery analysis"},{"text":"Injury-risk modelling"},{"text":"Adaptive training recommendations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Edge AI"},{"type":"p","text":"Models increasingly run directly on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Smartwatches"},{"text":"Sports sensors"},{"text":"Smart glasses"},{"text":"Smart clothing"},{"text":"Smart footwear"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Smart Textiles"},{"type":"p","text":"Emerging systems include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Conductive fibers"},{"text":"Textile pressure sensors"},{"text":"Flexible electronics"},{"text":"Stretch sensors"},{"text":"Electro